{"unit_id":"OrderG-X__dsh-pages#card-zh","repo":"OrderG-X/dsh-pages","commit":"744332ea1dfb562baed37d8721ad5ebd557f4ace","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-pages 让 DSH 模型把回答做成可交互网页：通过 show_page 工具提交模板数据或完整 HTML，并把页面嵌入对话或显示为缩略卡片。它提供报告、对比、清单、看板、时间线、学习卡片、测验和流程图模板，也支持手写页面；页面可跟随深浅色、保存交互状态、保留版本，并在右侧栏浏览、导出 HTML、PNG 或 PDF。适合把分析、计划、图表和小工具做成可操作页面的 DSH 用户。无需 API 密钥；PNG/PDF 导出和自动体检需要本机可用的 Chrome 或 Edge。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:182","lib/index.js:484","lib/client.js:790","lib/store.js:124","lib/templates.js:1068"]}
{"unit_id":"OrderG-X__dsh-pages#card-en","repo":"OrderG-X/dsh-pages","commit":"744332ea1dfb562baed37d8721ad5ebd557f4ace","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-pages turns DSH answers into interactive pages using eight templates or supplied HTML. Pages appear in chat or the sidebar, follow light and dark themes, retain versions and state, and export as HTML, PNG, or PDF. No API key is needed; Chrome or Edge is required for checks and image/PDF export.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:182","lib/index.js:484","lib/client.js:790","lib/store.js:124","lib/templates.js:1068"]}
